    title: "Proven Medicare Lead Retention Strategies for Insurance Agents",
    metaTitle: "Proven Medicare Lead Retention Strategies",
    excerpt: "A systematic, agency-level framework for building a proven Medicare client retention program.",
    metaDescription: "Enrolling a Medicare client is only step one — keeping them through the next switching window is where retention happens. This framework covers the steps.",
    category: "Medicare Leads",
    readTime: "8 min read",
    publishedDate: "2026-11-17",
